From aede4e0fb0408c68ec3551696171a67b6a761523 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: gogetwoo <heavensgate82@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 27 Oct 2026 21:31:51 -0500
Subject: [PATCH] platform: wayland data-control clipboard fallback for portals
 without a Clipboard interface

xdg-desktop-portal-hyprland (InputCapture v1) has no Clipboard interface,
so the server ran without clipboard sharing. When the portal session reports
no clipboard, fall back to ext-data-control-v1: read the local selection when
input capture activates, and offer the remote clipboard locally when a client
grabs it. Format conversion reuses PortalClipboard.
---
 src/lib/platform/CMakeLists.txt           |  28 ++
 src/lib/platform/DataControlClipboard.cpp | 387 ++++++++++++++++++++++
 src/lib/platform/DataControlClipboard.h   | 111 +++++++
 src/lib/platform/EiComputer.cpp           |   5 +-
 src/lib/platform/PortalInputCapture.cpp   | 133 +++++++-
 src/lib/platform/PortalInputCapture.h     |   7 +
 6 files changed, 669 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)
 create mode 100644 src/lib/platform/DataControlClipboard.cpp
 create mode 100644 src/lib/platform/DataControlClipboard.h

